        "documentAction": {
          "visibility": "system",
          "form": false,
          "displayLogic": null,
          "agentPrompt": "Document workflow action for this purchase invoice. Fire it with neo_action, sending the chosen value as parameters.docAction (e.g. {\"docAction\":\"CO\"}). From documentStatus=DR (Draft): CO completes the invoice — it computes taxes and totals and creates the payment plan; VO voids it. From documentStatus=CO (Completed): RE reactivates it back to DR, and the UI unposts the invoice first when it was already posted — so check the posted field and expect the accounting entries to be removed. CL closes it. Preconditions for CO: at least one line, a vendor with payment terms, and an open period for the accounting date. Completing does NOT post to the ledger: posting is a separate action on this window (not a documentAction value), so never send PO here — read the posted field to know the accounting state. Read documentStatus and posted with neo_get before acting. The remaining values offered in actionValues (AP, PR, RA, RC, RJ, XL) come from the shared AD list and are not part of this window's flow."
        },
